  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "领导回了一个“嗯”，",
      "startMs": 276.9230769230769,
      "endMs": 1352.3076923076922,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你把聊天记录翻了十遍。",
      "startMs": 1384.6153846153845,
      "endMs": 2890.7692307692305,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "事情还没变，",
      "startMs": 3261.5384615384614,
      "endMs": 4152.307692307692,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你已经在脑子里，",
      "startMs": 4276.923076923077,
      "endMs": 5290.7692307692305,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "替自己开完了一场批斗会。",
      "startMs": 5261.538461538461,
      "endMs": 6921.538461538461,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "很多内耗，",
      "startMs": 7261.538461538461,
      "endMs": 7936.923076923076,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "就从这里开始：",
      "startMs": 7907.692307692308,
      "endMs": 8706.153846153846,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "别人给你一个模糊的信号，",
      "startMs": 9076.923076923076,
      "endMs": 10521.538461538461,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你却急着给自己一个确定的判决。",
      "startMs": 10676.923076923076,
      "endMs": 12613.846153846154,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "猜得越多，",
      "startMs": 13046.153846153846,
      "endMs": 13813.846153846154,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "越忘了手头真正要做什么。",
      "startMs": 13784.615384615385,
      "endMs": 15475.384615384615,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "建立自己的框架，",
      "startMs": 15569.23076923077,
      "endMs": 16521.53846153846,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "不是认定“我感觉的就是真相”，",
      "startMs": 16646.153846153844,
      "endMs": 18613.846153846152,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "也不是谁的话都不听。",
      "startMs": 18830.76923076923,
      "endMs": 19998.46153846154,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "是把事实、猜测和行动，",
      "startMs": 20400.0,
      "endMs": 22429.23076923077,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "分开处理。",
      "startMs": 22461.53846153846,
      "endMs": 23260.0,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第一，",
      "startMs": 23600.0,
      "endMs": 23967.69230769231,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "只认已经发生的事。",
      "startMs": 24184.615384615383,
      "endMs": 25536.923076923074,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "他回复很短，",
      "startMs": 25753.846153846152,
      "endMs": 26644.615384615383,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这是事实；",
      "startMs": 26769.23076923077,
      "endMs": 27475.384615384613,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "他对我不满，",
      "startMs": 27938.46153846154,
      "endMs": 28736.923076923074,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这是猜测。",
      "startMs": 28800.0,
      "endMs": 29444.615384615383,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把两者写在两张纸上，",
      "startMs": 29753.846153846152,
      "endMs": 31413.846153846152,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你会发现，",
      "startMs": 31415.384615384613,
      "endMs": 31998.46153846154,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "让你焦虑的，",
      "startMs": 32000.0,
      "endMs": 32921.53846153846,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "往往是第二张。",
      "startMs": 32861.53846153846,
      "endMs": 33629.230769230766,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第二，",
      "startMs": 34215.38461538462,
      "endMs": 34552.30769230769,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把猜心变成确认。",
      "startMs": 34492.30769230769,
      "endMs": 35936.92307692308,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "与其反复琢磨他的语气，",
      "startMs": 36246.153846153844,
      "endMs": 37906.153846153844,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "不如问清楚：",
      "startMs": 38246.153846153844,
      "endMs": 39136.92307692308,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这份方案，",
      "startMs": 39230.76923076923,
      "endMs": 39967.692307692305,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "最需要改的是哪一处？",
      "startMs": 40061.53846153846,
      "endMs": 41629.230769230766,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把模糊的态度，",
      "startMs": 41876.92307692308,
      "endMs": 42890.76923076923,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "变成具体的要求。",
      "startMs": 42861.53846153846,
      "endMs": 43967.692307692305,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第三，",
      "startMs": 44369.230769230766,
      "endMs": 44706.153846153844,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "给自己的行动定标准。",
      "startMs": 44953.84615384615,
      "endMs": 46552.30769230769,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "今天交付什么，",
      "startMs": 46830.76923076923,
      "endMs": 47813.84615384615,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "质量怎样判断，",
      "startMs": 47846.153846153844,
      "endMs": 48921.53846153846,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "哪些要求需要重新协商。",
      "startMs": 49107.692307692305,
      "endMs": 50983.07692307692,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "标准越清楚，",
      "startMs": 51230.76923076923,
      "endMs": 52090.76923076923,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你就越不容易跟着别人的脸色跑。",
      "startMs": 52184.61538461538,
      "endMs": 54029.230769230766,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "如果意见有事实依据，",
      "startMs": 54369.230769230766,
      "endMs": 56090.76923076923,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "就调整；",
      "startMs": 56061.53846153846,
      "endMs": 56644.61538461538,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "如果只有情绪和贬低，",
      "startMs": 56923.07692307692,
      "endMs": 58306.153846153844,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "就明确边界。",
      "startMs": 58430.76923076923,
      "endMs": 59290.76923076923,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "你可以听取反馈，",
      "startMs": 59784.61538461538,
      "endMs": 61013.84615384615,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "但不必把每一句评价，",
      "startMs": 61384.61538461538,
      "endMs": 62952.30769230769,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "都变成对自己的判决。",
      "startMs": 62984.61538461538,
      "endMs": 64275.38461538461,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "下一次再想翻聊天记录，",
      "startMs": 64769.230769230766,
      "endMs": 66306.15384615384,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "先停一下：",
      "startMs": 66369.23076923077,
      "endMs": 67044.61538461538,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "我知道的事实是什么？",
      "startMs": 67353.84615384616,
      "endMs": 68613.84615384616,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "还有什么需要问清？",
      "startMs": 69015.38461538461,
      "endMs": 69967.69230769231,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
